  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound skinless, boneless chicken breast halves - cubed",
    "1 cup sliced carrots",
    "1 cup frozen green peas",
    "0.5 cup sliced celery",
    "0.33333334326744 cup butter",
    "0.33333334326744 cup chopped onion",
    "0.33333334326744 cup all-purpose flour",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "0.25 teaspoon black pepper",
    "0.25 teaspoon celery seed",
    "1.75 cups chicken broth",
    "0.66666668653488 cup milk",
    "2 (9 inch) unbaked pie crusts"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F (220 degrees C).",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/SMMTlCCsBe1nxndDnCNOu6qzi3A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-IX-mfs-step-1-437-37e574602aa14705a9055079b394e273.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine chicken, carrots, peas, and celery in a saucepan; add water to cover. Bring to a boil; boil for 15 minutes. Drain.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/N5mwz4LxAR1uNcIQlXSFpYBXSWo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-IX-mfs-step-2-440-b0b5c2dc59a44385801b76b13946ce7e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt butter in a separate saucepan over medium heat. Add onion; cook until soft and translucent, 5 to 7 minutes. Stir in flour, salt, black pepper, and celery seeds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/mF0wKLB37PpkbsWoF41WTPCipeE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-IX-mfs-step-4-449-0395855878f04080b27c0ced0b7a9243.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Slowly stir in chicken broth and milk.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E2ktPyYLmQ8PqvELq3X_AykF_k0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-IX-mfs-step-5-454-e0b5f720d2d345399d8d150500108748.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Reduce heat to medium-low; simmer until thick, 5 to 10 minutes. Set aside off heat.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ehlYkqTsqYkWIdJP5aLcP1JZ78Y=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-IX-mfs-step-5-459-16f6e9b9350a48eeb10cbe4dffb9188d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place 1 crust in a 9-inch pie plate; add chicken and vegetables to the crust. Pour hot broth mixture over top.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B9tYe7lFUrVpxMgKS4P4L5qz0y4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-IX-mfs-step-6-462-699787c97281479c9cdf8dc1fc8e2541.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover pie with top crust, seal the edges, and trim any excess dough. Make several small slits in top crust to allow steam to escape.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Z9m_M6S1OobAhKcE3HrxtZ-31iU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-IX-mfs-step-7-466-0c57b9ee2a0146ed9ad4f9c41654bb7b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until pastry is golden brown and filling is bubbly, 30 to 35 minutes. Cool for 10 minutes before serving.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/l2xNBnBqq8qi3Khnz0DQ4l9y65A=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-IX-mfs-step-8-469-75ff348079b740c3ba081c212640927e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/FoWxveKFkL2_cQIzGmsEWSnf7ec=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/26317-chicken-pot-pie-VAT-Beauty-4x3-ab621b52d3c44a3ca4eac45b1a8e3585.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/26317/step_09.webp"
    }
  ],
